### User Management API (needs a manager token; other roles get 403 / 4101)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5121/api
@token = <paste data.token from the login response>

### Log in as a manager and copy data.token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "manager", "password": "<your password>" }

### Roles that can be assigned (with their default passwords)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List (sorted by username). All filters optional; dates are instants (createdBefore is exclusive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=off&role=officer&createdFrom=2026-09-01T00:00:00%2B06:30&createdBefore=2026-10-01T00:00:00%2B06:30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create (password = role default, must be changed at first login) -> 201; duplicate -> 409 4305 / 4306
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Aung Kyaw Moe", "username": "aung.kyawmoe", "email": "aung.kyawmoe@bams.local", "phone": "09 123 456 789", "role": "officer" }

### Update (full) -> 200; demoting the last active manager -> 422 4480
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Aung Kyaw Moe", "username": "aung.kyawmoe", "email": "aung.kyawmoe@bams.local", "phone": null, "role": "auditor" }

### Reset password to the role default -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/4/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft delete -> 204; the user's login then fails with 403 4004; last active manager -> 422 4480
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
